Package: oralExam
Title: Shiny interface to manage an oral exam for larger classes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jos", "Dornschneider-Elkink", , "jos@joselkink.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Based on a list of potential oral exam questions, it provides an interface to time the exam, show randomly selected exam questions, and track feedback. The assumed context is one where a large number of quick exams have to be performed, e.g. for a large undergraduate class, and the lecturer has to keep track of progress and potential questions.
